{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47668","headline":"直指大丹歌 · 吕岩","name":"直指大丹歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三清宫殿隐崑巅，日月光浮起紫烟。\n池沼泓泓翻玉液，楼台叠叠运灵泉。\n青龙乘火铅爲汞，白虎腾波汞作铅。\n欲得坎男求匹偶，须凭离女结因缘。\n黄婆设尽千般计，金鼎开成一朵莲。\n列女擎乌当左畔，将军戴兔镇西边。\n黑龟却伏红炉下，朱雀还栖华阁前。\n然後澄神窥见影，三周功就驾云軿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47668.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47668","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}